1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Lennox is dead. I killed him.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Nobody said to me the first time we met.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,000
He said, don't trust them.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,500
I don't believe in Quinson as his either.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
They were right about you, Geller.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Right about what?

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Your predictability.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
You did everything the psychologist said you do.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
What the fuck is going on here?

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Lennox is not dead. He's very much alive.

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
And thanks to the mess you created,

12
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
we can hunt him down without Congress breathing down our necks.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
You have untied our hands.

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,500
What are you talking about?

15
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,500
You're right.

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,500
Nothing is a coincidence, Sergeant Keller.

17
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,000
I am going to destroy William Lennox

18
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,500
and you are going to help me.

19
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,500
What about the charges?

20
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,500
My trial?

21
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,500
You will die in a fiery crash on your way to the hearing.

22
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,500
As far as anyone is concerned,

23
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
this fiasco will end with your death.

24
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,500
You made it through, Sergeant.

25
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,500
You crossed the finish line.

26
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:06,460
A while back, you said you wanted to kill Lennox so bad you could taste it.

27
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:10,520
Can you still taste it, Sergeant Keller?

28
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,520
Yes.

29
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,200
Then let us begin.
